    "items/GetItemVolume": {
      "comment": "OptS32* GetItemVolume(OptS32* out /*hidden*/, const ItemInfo* item): the Volume impact value of an item; actor_interaction's TransferFuelEvent cap (its only caller). A null item gives {18, 1}",
